```

Open http://localhost:8080 for the dashboard.

---

## 4. Running without Docker

```bash
npm install

# Postgres + Redis only
docker compose up -d postgres redis

npm run migration:run
npm run seed

# API on :3000 and the Vite dev server on :5173, together
